   "source": [
    "# Ders 2: Sığ ve Derin Sinir Ağları\n",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4dc74b91",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "print(\"Kutuphaneler hazir.\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3fd846a2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Aktivasyon Fonksiyonları\n",
    "\n",
    "Prince kitabında ReLU'yu merkeze alır. Farklı aktivasyon fonksiyonlarını karşılaştıralım.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "425c9d0f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "x = np.linspace(-4, 4, 300)\n",
    "\n",
    "relu    = np.maximum(0, x)\n",
    "sigmoid = 1 / (1 + np.exp(-x))\n",
    "tanh_v  = np.tanh(x)\n",
    "leaky   = np.where(x > 0, x, 0.1 * x)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(12, 8))\n",
    "for ax, (name, y, color) in zip(axes.flat,\n",
    "        [(\"ReLU\", relu, 'crimson'),\n",
    "         (\"Sigmoid\", sigmoid, 'steelblue'),\n",
    "         (\"Tanh\", tanh_v, 'darkorange'),\n",
    "         (\"Leaky ReLU (a=0.1)\", leaky, 'purple')]):\n",
    "    ax.plot(x, y, color=color, lw=2)\n",
    "    ax.axhline(0, color='gray', lw=0.7, linestyle='--')\n",
    "    ax.axvline(0, color='gray', lw=0.7, linestyle='--')\n",
    "    ax.set_title(name, fontsize=13)\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel(\"x\"); ax.set_ylabel(\"sigma(x)\")\n",
    "    ax.set_ylim(-1.5, 4.5)\n",
    "    ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Aktivasyon Fonksiyonlari\", fontsize=15, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb02_activations.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4ce7a290",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Sığ Sinir Ağı (Ch. 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "Kitabın formülasyonuna göre bir sığ ağ:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$h_k = \\text{ReLU}(\\theta_{k0} + \\theta_{k1} x)$$\n",
    "$$y = \\phi_0 + \\sum_{k=1}^{K} \\phi_k h_k$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Her gizli nöron bir **doğrusal parça (linear region)** oluşturur.  \n",
    "Bu parçaları birleştirerek karmaşık fonksiyonlar yaklaşılır.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "604b7a50",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def shallow_net_1d(x, theta0, theta1, phi0, phi):\n",
    "    # K gizli noronlu sigh ag\n",
    "    # theta0, theta1: shape (K,)\n",
    "    # phi0: skaler, phi: shape (K,)\n",
    "    H = np.maximum(0, theta0[:, None] + theta1[:, None] * x[None, :])  # (K, N)\n",
    "    return phi0 + phi @ H  # (N,)\n",
    "\n",
    "x_plot = np.linspace(-3*np.pi, 3*np.pi, 500)\n",
    "y_target = np.sin(x_plot)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(16, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "for ax, K in zip(axes, [4, 16, 64]):\n",
    "    np.random.seed(7)\n",
    "    theta0 = np.random.uniform(-3, 3, K)\n",
    "    theta1 = np.random.uniform(-2, 2, K)\n",
    "    phi0   = np.random.randn() * 0.1\n",
    "    phi    = np.random.randn(K) * 0.5\n",
    "    \n",
    "    y_pred = shallow_net_1d(x_plot, theta0, theta1, phi0, phi)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    ax.plot(x_plot, y_target, 'gray', lw=1.5, alpha=0.6, label=\"Hedef: sin(x)\")\n",
    "    ax.plot(x_plot, y_pred, 'crimson', lw=1.5, label=f\"Sigh ag (K={K})\")\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f\"{K} Gizli Noron (rastgele init)\")\n",
    "    ax.set_ylim(-4, 4); ax.legend(fontsize=8); ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Sigh Ag ile Fonksiyon Yaklasimi (rastgele agirliklar)\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb02_shallow.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d65cbed0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Evrensel Yaklaşım Teoremi — Görsel Kanıt\n",
    "\n",
    "Teoreme göre yeterli sayıda gizli nöronla sığ bir ağ **herhangi bir sürekli fonksiyonu** istenen hassasiyette yaklaşabilir.  \n",
    "Her ReLU nöronu bir \"kırık çizgi katkısı\" sağlar; bunları toplayarak karmaşık şekiller oluştururuz.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "b96115fe",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "x = np.linspace(-2, 2, 500)\n",
    "colors = plt.cm.tab10(np.linspace(0, 1, 5))\n",
    "individual = []\n",
    "params = [(-1.5, 1, 0.8), (0, 1, -1.2), (0.5, 2, 0.6), (-0.8, -1, -0.5), (1.2, 1.5, 0.9)]\n",
    "for i, (t0, t1, ph) in enumerate(params):\n",
    "    h = np.maximum(0, t0 + t1*x)\n",
    "    contribution = ph * h\n",
    "    individual.append(contribution)\n",
    "    axes[0].plot(x, contribution, color=colors[i], lw=1.5, label=f\"phi{i+1}*ReLU()\")\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Bireysel ReLU Katkilari\")\n",
    "axes[0].legend(fontsize=7); axes[0].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "axes[0].axhline(0, color='k', lw=0.5)\n",
    "\n",
    "total = sum(individual)\n",
    "axes[1].plot(x, total, 'crimson', lw=2.5, label=\"Toplam cikti\")\n",
    "axes[1].fill_between(x, total, alpha=0.15, color='crimson')\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Katkilarin Toplami -> Karmasik Fonksiyon\")\n",
    "axes[1].legend(); axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "axes[1].axhline(0, color='k', lw=0.5)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb02_universal.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "edf2fd66",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Derin Sinir Ağı (Ch. 4)\n",
    "\n",
    "Derin ağlarda katmanlar **birbirinin üzerine kompoze edilir**:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\mathbf{h}_1 = a(\\mathbf{W}_1 \\mathbf{x} + \\mathbf{b}_1)$$\n",
    "$$\\mathbf{h}_k = a(\\mathbf{W}_k \\mathbf{h}_{k-1} + \\mathbf{b}_k)$$\n",
    "$$\\mathbf{y} = \\mathbf{W}_{K+1} \\mathbf{h}_K + \\mathbf{b}_{K+1}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Her katman girdiyi yeni bir **özellik uzayına** dönüştürür.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "e5e22577",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def relu(x):\n",
    "    return np.maximum(0, x)\n",
    "\n",
    "def forward_pass(x, weights, biases):\n",
    "    h = x.copy()\n",
    "    for i, (W, b) in enumerate(zip(weights, biases)):\n",
    "        z = h @ W.T + b\n",
    "        h = relu(z) if i < len(weights)-1 else z\n",
    "    return h\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(13)\n",
    "x_1d = np.linspace(-np.pi, np.pi, 300).reshape(-1, 1)\n",
    "y_target_1d = np.sin(x_1d) * np.cos(2 * x_1d)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "configs = [\n",
    "    (\"Sigh: 1 katman, 100 noron\",\n",
    "     [np.random.randn(100,1)*0.5, np.random.randn(1,100)*0.3],\n",
    "     [np.random.randn(100)*0.1, np.random.randn(1)*0.1]),\n",
    "    (\"Derin: 4 katman, 25 noron/katman\",\n",
    "     [np.random.randn(25,1)*0.5, np.random.randn(25,25)*0.3,\n",
    "      np.random.randn(25,25)*0.3, np.random.randn(1,25)*0.3],\n",
    "     [np.random.randn(25)*0.1, np.random.randn(25)*0.1,\n",
    "      np.random.randn(25)*0.1, np.random.randn(1)*0.1])\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for ax, (name, Ws, Bs) in zip(axes, configs):\n",
    "    y_pred = forward_pass(x_1d, Ws, Bs).flatten()\n",
    "    total_params = sum(W.size + b.size for W, b in zip(Ws, Bs))\n",
    "    ax.plot(x_1d, y_target_1d, 'gray', lw=1.5, alpha=0.7, label=\"Hedef\")\n",
    "    ax.plot(x_1d, y_pred, 'steelblue', lw=2, label=\"Ag tahmini\")\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f\"{name}\\n(Toplam parametre: {total_params})\")\n",
    "    ax.legend(); ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Sigh vs Derin Ag (rastgele baslangic - egitim yok)\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb02_deep_vs_shallow.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c3bf5db4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Parametre Sayısı Karşılaştırması\n",
    "\n",
    "Bir ağdaki toplam parametre sayısını hesaplayalım:\n",
    "- **Sığ**: giriş→H + H→çıkış  \n",
    "- **Derin**: her katman kendi W ve b'sine sahip\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1826ef5c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def count_params(layer_sizes):\n",
    "    total = 0\n",
    "    for i in range(len(layer_sizes)-1):\n",
    "        W_params = layer_sizes[i] * layer_sizes[i+1]\n",
    "        b_params = layer_sizes[i+1]\n",
    "        total += W_params + b_params\n",
    "    return total\n",
    "\n",
    "architectures = {\n",
    "    \"Sigh [1,64,1]\":         [1, 64, 1],\n",
    "    \"Derin [1,16,16,16,16,1]\": [1, 16, 16, 16, 16, 1],\n",
    "    \"Derin [1,8,8,8,8,8,8,1]\": [1, 8, 8, 8, 8, 8, 8, 1],\n",
    "    \"Genis [1,128,1]\":         [1, 128, 1],\n",
    "    \"Derin-Genis [1,32,32,32,1]\":[1,32,32,32,1],\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"{'Mimari':<35} {'Parametreler':>12} {'Katman':>8}\")\n",
    "print(\"-\"*57)\n",
    "for name, layers in architectures.items():\n",
    "    params = count_params(layers)\n",
    "    depth = len(layers) - 1\n",
    "    print(f\"{name:<35} {params:>12,} {depth:>8}\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0034977b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Özet\n",
    "\n",
    "| Kavram | Açıklama |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **Sığ ağ** | Tek gizli katman; evrensel yaklaşım mümkün ama verimsiz |\n",
    "| **Derin ağ** | Çoklu katman; üstel bölge artışı, hiyerarşik temsil |\n",
    "| **ReLU** | En yaygın aktivasyon; türev hesabı kolay, gradyan yok olması az |\n",
    "| **Evrensel yaklaşım** | Yeterli nöronla her sürekli fonksiyon yaklaşılabilir |\n",
    "| **Derinlik avantajı** | Aynı parametreyle çok daha karmaşık fonksiyon uzayı |\n",
    "| **İleri geçiş (forward pass)** | Girdiden çıktıya sıralı matris çarpımları |\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  }
